cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it by its release version or exact commit, together with the paper."
title: "stratonovich-ham-second-moment-lean: Lean companion to the second moment of the Stratonovich hyperbolic Anderson model"
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
version: "0.9.0"
date-released: "2026-11-13"
repository-code: "https://github.com/chenle02/stratonovich-ham-second-moment-lean"
authors:
  - family-names: "Chen"
    given-names: "Le"
    affiliation: "Auburn University"
abstract: >-
  Lean 4 checks of the finite, algebraic, scalar and selected analytic steps
  of the paper on the second moment of the Stratonovich hyperbolic Anderson
  model with time-dependent noise. Each Lean statement is mapped to the
  manuscript label it supports in docs/statement-ledger.md; analytic and
  probabilistic inputs that stay outside Lean enter as explicit named
  hypotheses. This is a partial formalization, not an end-to-end
  verification of the paper.
keywords:
  - Lean 4
  - hyperbolic Anderson model
  - stochastic wave equation
  - moment asymptotics
  - Stratonovich integral
  - formal verification
references:
  - type: unpublished
    title: "The second moment of the hyperbolic Anderson model"
    authors:
      - family-names: "Chen"
        given-names: "Le"
        affiliation: "Auburn University"
    notes: "Manuscript in preparation; the Lean statements are mapped to its labels in docs/statement-ledger.md."
